ria-expanded=\"false\" href=\"/docs/category/subscription-payment\">Subscription payment</a><button aria-label=\"Toggle the collapsible sidebar category 'Subscription payment'\" type=\"button\" class=\"clean-btn menu__caret\"></button></div></li><li class=\"theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed\"><div class=\"menu__list-item-collapsible\"><a class=\"menu__link menu__link--sublist\" aria-expanded=\"false\" href=\"/docs/category/inapp-sdk-integration\">InApp SDK Integration</a><button aria-label=\"Toggle the collapsible sidebar category 'InApp SDK Integration'\" type=\"button\" class=\"clean-btn menu__caret\"></button></div></li><li class=\"theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed\"><div class=\"menu__list-item-collapsible\"><a class=\"menu__link menu__link--sublist\" aria-expanded=\"false\" href=\"/docs/category/sim-swap-api\">SIM Swap API</a><button aria-label=\"Toggle the collapsible sidebar category 'SIM Swap API'\" type=\"button\" class=\"clean-btn menu__caret\"></button></div></li><li class=\"theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed\"><div class=\"menu__list-item-collapsible\"><a class=\"menu__link menu__link--sublist\" aria-expanded=\"false\" href=\"/docs/category/mini-app-development-guide\">Mini App Development Guide</a><button aria-label=\"Toggle the collapsible sidebar category 'Mini App Development Guide'\" type=\"button\" class=\"clean-btn menu__caret\"></button></div></li></ul></nav></div></div></aside><main class=\"docMainContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocPage-Layout-Main-styles-module\"><div class=\"container padding-top--md padding-bottom--lg\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col docItemCol_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocItem-Layout-styles-module\"><div class=\"docItemContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocItem-Layout-styles-module\"><article><nav class=\"theme-doc-breadcrumbs breadcrumbsContainer_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocBreadcrumbs-styles-module\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumbs\"><ul class=\"breadcrumbs\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\"><a aria-label=\"Home page\" class=\"breadcrumbs__link\" href=\"/docs/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"breadcrumbHomeIcon_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocBreadcrumbs-Items-Home-styles-module\"><path d=\"M10 19v-5h4v5c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-7h1.7c.46 0 .68-.57.33-.87L12.67 3.6c-.38-.34-.96-.34-1.34 0l-8.36 7.53c-.34.3-.13.87.33.87H5v7c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></a></li><li itemscope=\"\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\" class=\"breadcrumbs__item breadcrumbs__item--active\"><span class=\"breadcrumbs__link\" itemprop=\"name\">Welcome to our Payment Integration Platform!</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\"></li></ul></nav><div class=\"tocCollapsible_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-TOCCollapsible-styles-module theme-doc-toc-mobile tocMobile_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-DocItem-TOC-Mobile-styles-module\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"clean-btn tocCollapsibleButton_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-TOCCollapsible-CollapseButton-styles-module\">On this page</button></div><div class=\"theme-doc-markdown markdown\"><h1>Welcome to our Payment Integration Platform!</h1><p>We offer a range of integration options to help you process payments seamlessly and efficiently. Whether you're a small business owner or a large enterprise, our platform can help you manage your payments more effectively. Here are some of the payment integration options we offer:</p><h1>telebirr Payment Gateway Integration Options</h1><p>telebirr is a mobile financial services platform that allows individuals and businesses to make and receive payments, buy airtime, and access a range of financial services. The platform offers four integration options that make it easy for developers to integrate telebirr's payment gateway into their applications.</p><h2 class=\"anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-Heading-styles-module\" id=\"b2b-integration\">B2B Integration<a href=\"#b2b-integration\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Direct link to B2B Integration\" title=\"Direct link to B2B Integration\">​</a></h2><p>B2B integration enables businesses to integrate telebirr's payment gateway into their existing systems, making it easy to receive payments from customers. This integration option is ideal for businesses that want to automate their payment processes and reduce the time and effort required to manage payments.</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"B2B Integration Process\" src=\"/docs/assets/images/b2b-daeb937665678bc63bc3f00f359ca801.jpg\" width=\"1000\" height=\"699\" class=\"img_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-MDXComponents-Img-styles-module\"></p><h2 class=\"anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-Heading-styles-module\" id=\"c2b-integration\">C2B Integration<a href=\"#c2b-integration\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Direct link to C2B Integration\" title=\"Direct link to C2B Integration\">​</a></h2><p>With C2B integration, individuals can easily make payments to businesses using telebirr's payment gateway. This integration option is ideal for businesses that want to offer their customers a convenient and secure way to make payments.</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"C2B Integration Process\" src=\"/docs/assets/images/c2b-83fc7b15f66eec3c558892c84be3f7d0.jpg\" width=\"998\" height=\"701\" class=\"img_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-MDXComponents-Img-styles-module\"></p><h2 class=\"anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-Heading-styles-module\" id=\"h5-integration\">H5 Integration<a href=\"#h5-integration\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Direct link to H5 Integration\" title=\"Direct link to H5 Integration\">​</a></h2><p>H5 integration enables businesses to integrate telebirr's payment gateway into their mobile applications using HTML5 technology. This integration option is ideal for businesses that want to provide their customers with a seamless payment experience within their mobile apps.</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"H5 Integration Process\" src=\"/docs/assets/images/h5-aa1fdca2a9cca73b058f6e139c8c80e0.jpg\" width=\"999\" height=\"700\" class=\"img_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-MDXComponents-Img-styles-module\"></p><h2 class=\"anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-Heading-styles-module\" id=\"mini-app-integration\">Mini App Integration<a href=\"#mini-app-integration\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Direct link to Mini App Integration\" title=\"Direct link to Mini App Integration\">​</a></h2><p>Mini app integration enables businesses to integrate telebirr's payment gateway into their mini apps, which are lightweight applications that can be accessed within messaging apps. This integration option is ideal for businesses that want to offer their customers a convenient way to make payments within messaging apps.</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Mini App Integration Process\" src=\"/docs/assets/images/mini-4b2d0cf328e96107d5d365151c6a21c6.jpg\" width=\"957\" height=\"995\" class=\"img_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-MDXComponents-Img-styles-module\"></p><p>By integrating telebirr's payment gateway into your business, you can provide your customers with a convenient and secure way to make payments. Choose the integration option that best suits your needs and follow the tutorial to get started.</p><h2 class=\"anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-Heading-styles-module\" id=\"subscription-payment\">Subscription payment<a href=\"#subscription-payment\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Direct link to Subscription payment\" title=\"Direct link to Subscription payment\">​</a></h2><p>A Subscription payment API (Application Programming Interface) is a software interface that allows merchants to automate and manage the scheduling and processing of payments. It enables businesses to create and manage payment schedules for their customers, ensuring timely and hassle-free transactions.</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Schedule Payment\" src=\"/docs/assets/images/sub-b6af9bb2e78daf729f2d982b165b2734.jpg\" width=\"2142\" height=\"1298\" class=\"img_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-MDXComponents-Img-styles-module\"></p><p>Subscription payment API empowers merchants offering subscription-based services by simplifying billing processes, enhancing customer experience, reducing churn, and providing greater control over revenue management. It enables merchants to focus on delivering value to their subscribers while ensuring smooth and reliable payment transactions.</p></div></article><nav class=\"pagination-nav docusaurus-mt-lg\" aria-label=\"Docs pages\"><a class=\"pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--next\" href=\"/docs/category/h5-integration-with-superapp\"><div class=\"pagination-nav__sublabel\">Next</div><div class=\"pagination-nav__label\">H5 Integration with SuperApp</div></a></nav></div></div><div class=\"col col--3\"><div class=\"tableOfContents_node_modules-@docusaurus-theme-classic-lib-theme-TOC-styles-module thin-scrollbar theme-doc-toc-desktop\"><ul class=\"table-of-contents table-of-contents__left-border\"><li><a href=\"#b2b-integration\" class=\"table-of-contents__link toc-highlight\">B2B Integration</a></li><li><a href=\"#c2b-integration\" class=\"table-of-contents__link toc-highlight\">C2B Integration</a></li><li><a href=\"#h5-integration\" class=\"table-of-contents__link toc-highlight\">H5 Integration</a></li><li><a href=\"#mini-app-integration\" class=\"table-of-contents__link toc-highlight\">Mini App Integration</a></li><li><a href=\"#subscription-payment\" class=\"table-of-contents__link toc-highlight\">Subscription payment</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></main></div></div><footer class=\"footer footer--dark\"><div class=\"container container-fluid\"><div class=\"footer__bottom text--center\"><div class=\"footer__copyright\">Copyright 1894-2026 © Ethio telecom. All rights reserved.</div></div></div></footer></div>\n    \n    \n  \n\n</body></html>",
